---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Release The Beast"
  description="An animated short film about a boy named Aaron who discovers that his rage isn't the enemy — it's the power he never learned to use."
>

  <!-- Film Hero -->
  <section class="film-hero">
    <div class="film-hero-bg">
      <img
        src="/images/rtb-hero-still.jpg"
        alt=""
        class="film-hero-img"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="film-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container film-hero-content">
      <div class="film-hero-left">
        <p class="eyebrow">Everything You Can't Contain</p>
        <h1 class="display">
          Release<br />
          <span class="accent-text">The Beast</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="film-hero-logline">A 12-minute animated film about anger, gaming, and the voices in your head that won't shut up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="film-premiere">
        <p class="premiere-eyebrow">Now Streaming on YouTube</p>
        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fGHBh76NHuI"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="btn btn-primary"
        >Watch Now →</a>
        <a
          href="https://youtube.com/@ryzo-studio?si=r2Rim6EYLbyv04q6"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="btn btn-outline"
        >Subscribe on YouTube</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="film-hero-scroll-hint">
      <span>Scroll to explore</span>
      <div class="scroll-line"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Synopsis -->
  <section class="section" id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="film-synopsis">
        <div class="synopsis-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">The Story</span>
          <h2 class="subheadline">Aaron's got problems</h2>
          <p class="body-lg">
            Bullies at school, a game design contest deadline,
            and anger that won't quit. When his biggest rival humiliates him and even
            his mom can't help, something breaks. Literally. His unfinished gaming
            character, Stan, explodes into the real world as several rage-fueled
            versions of himself.
          </p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            There's CG Stan (pure overwhelm), Paper Stan (a bodybuilder samurai stuck
            in a notebook), Sticky Stan (jealous, always watching), and more. Aaron's
            bedroom is now a battlefield, his inner voices are running wild, and
            he has to work out whether the Stans are going to wreck everything or
            help him level up.
          </p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            Through tenacity, humor, and a willingness to follow the chaos all the
            way down, Aaron finds what's underneath his anger and learns what to do
            with it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="synopsis-visual">
          <div class="film-player">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/knN0Eb-OTiI?mute=1"
              class="film-video"
              title="Aaron's Got Problems — Release the Beast"
              frameborder="0"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
              allowfullscreen
            ></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Origin -->
  <section class="section origin-section">
    <div class="origin-bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/images/rtb-anger-bg.png" alt="" class="origin-bg-img" />
      <div class="origin-bg-overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
    <div class="origin-layout">
      <div class="origin-title-col">
        <h2 class="origin-display">our<br />take<br />on<br />anger</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="origin-body-col">
          <p class="body-lg">
            We live in an age where a boy's anger reads as dangerous before it reads as
            human. An angry kid can walk into a school and destroy everyone he associates
            with his pain. A digital bully can follow him home and keep at it after
            everyone else has logged off.
          </p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            Anger is a protective instinct, a signal worth listening to. The problem
            isn't that boys feel too much. The stories they get stop at anger.
          </p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            <em>Release the Beast</em> is a different kind of story. It goes into anger, and beyond.
          </p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            To make it, we found collaborators who listen to boys closely and
            compassionately. Researchers who study adolescent emotional development.
            Clinicians working directly with angry kids. Experts in applied anger
            management. And the boys themselves, who told us exactly what it feels
            like when nobody has the right words for what's happening inside them.
          </p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            The inner resources are already there. Boys don't need to be fixed. They
            need stories that take their inner lives seriously, and that show them
            what those feelings are for.
          </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Next Step -->
  <section class="section next-step-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="next-step-inner">
        <span class="eyebrow">Next Step</span>
        <h2 class="subheadline">Aaron built a game to deal with all this. You can play it.</h2>
        <a href="/rage-fighters" class="btn btn-primary">Play Rage Fighters</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Screenings -->
  <section class="section screen-section" id="watch">
    <div class="screen-bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/images/rtb-screen-bg.jpg" alt="" class="screen-bg-img" />
      <div class="screen-bg-overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="screen-inner">
        <span class="eyebrow">Screenings</span>
        <h2 class="subheadline">Screen the film.</h2>
        <p class="body-lg">
          Bring Release the Beast to your school, library, community center,
          or festival. We'll send discussion guides and activities, and we'll
          join for a live Q&amp;A if you want one.
        </p>
        <div class="screen-actions">
          <a href="/connect" class="btn btn-primary">Request a Screening</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


</Layout>

<style>
  .film-hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-block: 8rem 5rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .film-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .film-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    display: block;
  }

  .film-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 60% 30%, rgba(232, 53, 42, 0.12) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 70%, rgba(124, 92, 191, 0.15) 0%, transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(8, 3, 22, 0.22) 0%, rgba(8, 3, 22, 0.55) 100%);
  }

  /* Shared background for all sections */
  .section,
  .section-sm {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #080316 0%, #1c0832 100%);
  }

  .film-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .film-hero-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .film-hero-left .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .display {
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 10rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .accent-text {
    color: #E8352A;
  }

  /* Page-specific accent override */
  .eyebrow {
    color: #E8352A;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: #E8352A;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #ff4438;
  }

  .film-hero-logline {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .film-hero-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .film-premiere {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-end;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .premiere-eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #E8352A;
  }

  .premiere-date {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
    margin-top: -0.25rem;
  }

  .countdown {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .countdown-unit {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    min-width: 3.5rem;
  }

  .countdown-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .countdown-label {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.70);
  }

  .countdown-sep {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .coming-soon-splash {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 53, 42, 0.4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: rgba(232, 53, 42, 0.08);
  }

  .coming-soon-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #E8352A;
  }

  .countdown-live {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #E8352A;
  }

  .film-hero-scroll-hint {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2.5rem;
    right: var(--gutter);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .film-hero-scroll-hint span {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--fg-3);
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    text-orientation: mixed;
  }

  .scroll-line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 60px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--fg-3), transparent);
  }

  /* Synopsis */
  .film-synopsis {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .synopsis-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .synopsis-text .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .film-player {
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    background: #000;
    aspect-ratio: 16/9;
  }

  .film-video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* Themes */
  .themes-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .themes-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .themes-bg-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center center;
    display: block;
  }

  .themes-bg-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(8,3,22,0.55) 0%, rgba(8,3,22,0.28) 50%, rgba(8,3,22,0.45) 100%);
  }

  .themes-section .container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .themes-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .themes-header-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .themes-header-text .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .themes-header-text .subheadline {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .themes-ecosystem {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ecosystem-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    background: var(--bg-2);
  }

  .ecosystem-item:first-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .ecosystem-item p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .ecosystem-item strong {
    color: var(--fg-1);
  }

  .ecosystem-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #E8352A;
  }

  .ecosystem-skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .skill-tag {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 53, 42, 0.35);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    background: rgba(232, 53, 42, 0.08);
  }

  .btn-sm {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    padding: 0.5rem 1.1rem;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .themes-section .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .themes-section .subheadline {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }


  /* Origin */
  .origin-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    padding: 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .origin-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .origin-bg-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center center;
    display: block;
  }

  .origin-bg-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(8,3,22,0.45) 0%, rgba(8,3,22,0.55) 45%, rgba(8,3,22,0.82) 100%);
  }

  .origin-layout {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.9fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    min-height: 85vh;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding-block: 6rem;
  }

  .origin-title-col {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .origin-display {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(5.85rem, 11.7vw, 11.7rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #E8352A;
    text-transform: lowercase;
  }

  .origin-body-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .origin-body-col .body-lg {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90);
  }

  .origin-and-yet {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--fg-1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .film-hero-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .film-premiere {
      align-items: flex-start;
      text-align: left;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .origin-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      min-height: auto;
      padding-block: 4rem;
    }
  }

  /* Next Step */
  .next-step-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .next-step-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  /* Screen */
  .screen-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .screen-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .screen-bg-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
  }

  .screen-bg-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(8,3,22,0.65) 0%, rgba(8,3,22,0.32) 60%, rgba(8,3,22,0.15) 100%);
  }

  .screen-section .container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .screen-inner {
    max-width: 560px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .screen-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Game CTA */
  .game-cta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .game-cta-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .game-cta-inner > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .game-cta-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .game-cta-inner p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    max-width: 380px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .themes-header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .film-synopsis {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .game-cta-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
